# Typesense Schema Migrations in Laravel | Fabian Kirchhoff
created: 2026-05-10, last updated: 2026-07-29, [Read more](https://fabkho.dev/blog/typesense-schema-migrations-laravel)

Adding a field to a Typesense collection usually means: flush the collection, recreate it with the new schema, re-import every document.
...
Typesense collections have a strict schema.
Every field needs a name, type, and configuration before documents can include it.
...
Typesense's Collection API supports PATCH requests to add or remove fields from an existing collection without touching the documents already in it.
